SUMMARY:RESCHEDULED - English for Speakers of Other Languages (ESOL) for Beginners
DESCRIPTION:This class has been rescheduled to Tuesday\, June 2 in the 
 Tower Room.\n\n \n\nEnglish for Speakers of Other Languages (ESOL) for 
 Beginners is designed to assist adult students in mastering the English 
 language by emphasizing speaking\, listening\, reading\, and writing 
 skills. \n\nStudents should bring their own notebook and pencils for note 
 taking.\n\nRegistration is required. Please notify us at 
 adultprograms@montclairlibrary.org if you are going to miss class. If you 
 do not attend the classes without notifying us\, you will not be allowed to 
 register for our next English class.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Language
