CATEGORIES:Athletics
DESCRIPTION:Join Campus Recreation for a scenic biking adventure along the
  Henry Hudson Trail! This paved trail offers beautiful views of the Jerse
 y shoreline and is perfect for riders of all experience levels. Enjoy a r
 efreshing day outdoors while getting active and exploring one of New Jers
 ey’s most popular trails. A bike and helmet (required) are provided. Must
  have experience riding.\nHow do I sign-up?\n\nRegister online through Fu
 sion\, in the Student Recreation Center main office\, or over the phone (
 973-655-3340).\nCost for Students $10\;  $20 Faculty/Staff\nRegistration 
 Opens on Fusion on Tuesday\, May 26\, 2026\n\nWhere and when?\n\nJune 4th
 \, 2026\n9:00 am – 6:00 pm\nBegins and ends at the Student Recreation Cen
 ter\n\nWhat to bring: Water\, lunch\, sunscreen\, comfortable clothing\, 
 closed-toe shoes\, and a hat is recommended.\nPotential Hazards: Uneven t
 errain\, unpredictable weather changes\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydr
 ation\, and minor falls or collisions\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\n
 Additional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/
 engage/event/12474128
DTEND:20260604T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260604T043640Z
