SUMMARY:Christian Singles Meet & Greet  -Online Zoom Event
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nMeet & Gr
 eet for Christian Singles\, ages 25-45. This is an online event.\n\nI aske
 d Chat GPT some good questions to ask and we will be taking turns answerin
 g them. We will go through as many questions as we can in the limited time
 .\n\nChat GPT says:\n\n### 🌿 Faith & Relationship with Values\n\n* What
  role does your faith play in your daily life?\n* What does a Christ-cente
 red relationship mean to you?\n* What qualities are most important to you 
 in a partner?\n* How do you usually grow spiritually?\n* What’s somethin
 g God has been teaching you recently?\n* What kind of relationship do you 
 hope to have one day?\n* What are your biggest relationship values?\n* Wha
 t does healthy communication look like to you?\n* What kind of family envi
 ronment do you hope to build someday?\n* What does commitment mean to you?
 \n\n### 💛 Getting to Know Each Other\n\n* What’s your favorite way to
  spend your weekends?\n* What’s something people are usually surprised t
 o learn about you?\n* What’s a hobby or interest you wish you had more t
 ime for?\n* What kind of personality are you naturally drawn to?\n* Are yo
 u more introverted or extroverted?\n* What’s your favorite worship song 
 or Christian artist right now?\n* What’s one thing that always makes you
  feel encouraged?\n* What’s your favorite Bible verse and why?\n* What k
 ind of conversations do you enjoy most?\n* What’s something you’re pas
 sionate about?\n\n### 🤍 Deeper Christian Dating Questions\n\n* How do y
 ou handle conflict or disagreements?\n* What boundaries are important to y
 ou while dating?\n* What does spiritual leadership look like to you?\n* Ho
 w important is church involvement to you?\n* What are you praying for in y
 our future relationship?\n* How do you balance grace and accountability?\n
 * What kind of support helps you feel cared for?\n* What are some lessons 
 you’ve learned from past relationships?\n* How do you stay grounded duri
 ng difficult seasons?\n* What are your long-term goals and hopes?\n\n### 
 💍 Bible Study Questions\n\n* What’s one prayer God has answered in yo
 ur life?\n* What Bible story inspires you most?\n* What’s something you 
 appreciate in Christian friendships?\n* What does “loving like Jesus” 
 look like in relationships?\n* What’s one quality you admire in strong C
 hristian couples?\n* What’s something young Christians struggle with in 
 dating today?\n* How can relationships help people grow spiritually?\n* Wh
 at’s one piece of dating advice you think is underrated?\n* What’s you
 r favorite way to serve others?\n* What helps you stay encouraged in your 
 faith?\n\n### 🌸 Fun Questions\n\n* Beach or mountains?\n* Worship night
  or game night?\n* Sunrise or sunset?\n* Texting or FaceTime?\n* Sweet sna
 cks or salty snacks?\n* Road trip or staycation?\n* Big group hangout or o
 ne-on-one time?\n* Fancy dinner or casual café?\n* Books or podcasts?\n\n
 ### 📖 Fun but Meaningful\n\n* Which person in the Bible do you relate t
 o most and why?\n* If you could ask God one question right now\, what woul
 d it be?\n* What does your “dream life” look like if God is at the cen
 ter?
