SUMMARY:Bowling Night - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nThis is a
 n event for casual bowling at Montvale Lanes\, 14 W. Grand Ave. All are we
 lcome for **two games\, food and drinks**\, and any post- or pre-game hang
  out. Show up anytime! Questions or comments? You can message Andy Milone 
 on Meetup\, or call/text him at **201-234-9609**.\n\n\\*\\*\\* Before bowl
 ing\, we might stop by the Pizza Parlour\, 6 S. Kinderkamack Road in Montv
 ale\, for a few slices. Post a comment on the event page to gauge interest
 . **After bowling\, we'll definitely be heading to Davey's Irish Pub & Res
 taurant\, 5 Park St. in Montvale\, or The Ridge Diner\, 125 Kinderkamack R
 oad in Park Ridge\, at 10 p.m. for some food and/or drinks.** \\*\\*\\*\n\
 nAbout the group: People of all ages\, backgrounds and abilities are welco
 me! We're not professionals and we're not in a league. In fact\, we're a g
 roup of people who probably each won't score more than 100 points and will
  land more than our fair share of gutter balls. There's no pressure at all
 !!!! We're not here to analyze your form or technique.\n\nMore event detai
 ls: You pay for your own games\, food and drinks. Please bring cash. The a
 lley does not accept card. But there is an ATM on site. **The** **cost per
  player is $18 for two games** **and bowling shoes.** If you have your own
  shoes\, the cost is $12. Please try to bring exact change since Andy will
  have a limited amount of cash. If you bring a $20 bill and he doesn't hav
 e change\, any remainder would just go toward the bowling alley tip.\n\nFo
 od and drinks (alcoholic and non-alcoholic) are available on site\, plus t
 ables and an alley bar to hang at during the event. There is a dart board 
 and a few arcade games\, as well.\n\n**What do you do when you get there?*
 * First\, find the group inside around the front desk. Look for a growing 
 group of people! Call or text Andy Milone at 201-234-9609 if you can't fin
 d us. Once Andy secures the lanes\, please pay him before getting your bow
 ling shoes.\n\n**Please know that it is possible we have to wait 20-40 min
 utes until lane(s) free up.** It's also possible that we may have to reloc
 ate or cancel that night if there's a long wait list upon arrival. Please 
 keep that in mind if traveling from far away!\n\nFor those who don't have 
 cars or are looking to avoid driving\, the Montvale Train Station is only 
 like a five-minute walk from the bowling alley and can be reached via the 
 Pascack Valley Line. Last train leaves at 12:20 a.m. and heads toward Hobo
 ken. (https://gmtma.org/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/rail_system_map.jpg)\n\
 nMany thanks to Taylor\, one of our group participants\, for recommending 
 Montvale Lanes! You can learn more at: www.montvalelanes.com.\n\nHope you'
 ll join us for our 24th bowling event\, or consider attending one of our v
 olleyball\, ping pong\, skating or other activities -> www.meetup.com/nort
 h-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball\n\nIf interested in staying touch with 
 group members or conversing about future events\, feel free to inquire abo
 ut our WhatsApp group chat.
