SUMMARY:Congregational Meeting\, Immediately After Worship
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T123000
DTSTAMP:20260604T043658Z
UID:3fksqj0rekf2gm7sdcavletccq@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T120000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260520T143926Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><span>As a congregational church we are responsible for cha
 rting our own future. And we are called upon to cast our vote when importa
 nt decisions need to be made. On Sunday\, June 7th\, immediately following
  worship\, we will gather for a brief meeting to share updates and make de
 cisions important to our Church family. </span></p><p><span>Please join u
 s for a vote on our budget and upcoming slate of officers as well as infor
 mation on our finances\, MMO (FCC's preschool)\, and our plans to move for
 ward in growth and progress.  We look forward to sharing and discussing a
 ll of this with you!<br> <br>At a Congregational Meeting\, only church me
 mbers may vote\, but we welcome ALL interested friends of the church to at
 tend. Looking forward to seeing you there!</span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T143926Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:First Congregational Church Montclair
END:VEVENT
