DESCRIPTION:### Shomrei's Got Talent!\n\n  \n  \nJoin us for a special aft
 ernoon of singing and comedy\, celebrating the talent within our own Shomr
 ei community.  \nLight snacks and coffee will be served.   \n  \nPre-Regis
 tration required for non-members\; members are encouraged to pre-register.
