DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260609T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260609T203000
SUMMARY:Christian & Jewish Singles Meet & Greet  -Online Zoom Event
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nMeet & Gr
 eet for Christian & Jewish Singles\, ages 30 and over. This is an online e
 vent.\n\nI asked Chat GPT some good questions to ask and we will be taking
  turns answering them. We will go through as many questions as we can in t
 he limited time.\n\nChat GPT says:\n\n### 🌿 Faith & Relationship with V
 alues\n\n* What role does your faith play in your daily life?\n* What does
  a Christ-centered relationship mean to you?\n* What qualities are most im
 portant to you in a partner?\n* How do you usually grow spiritually?\n* Wh
 at’s something God has been teaching you recently?\n* What kind of relat
 ionship do you hope to have one day?\n* What are your biggest relationship
  values?\n* What does healthy communication look like to you?\n* What kind
  of family environment do you hope to build someday?\n* What does commitme
 nt mean to you?\n\n### 💛 Getting to Know Each Other\n\n* What’s your 
 favorite way to spend your weekends?\n* What’s something people are usua
 lly surprised to learn about you?\n* What’s a hobby or interest you wish
  you had more time for?\n* What kind of personality are you naturally draw
 n to?\n* Are you more introverted or extroverted?\n* What’s your favorit
 e worship song or Christian artist right now?\n* What’s one thing that a
 lways makes you feel encouraged?\n* What’s your favorite Bible verse and
  why?\n* What kind of conversations do you enjoy most?\n* What’s somethi
 ng you’re passionate about?\n\n### 🤍 Deeper Dating Questions\n\n* How
  do you handle conflict or disagreements?\n* What boundaries are important
  to you while dating?\n* What does spiritual leadership look like to you?\
 n* How important is church involvement to you?\n* What are you praying for
  in your future relationship?\n* How do you balance grace and accountabili
 ty?\n* What kind of support helps you feel cared for?\n* What are some les
 sons you’ve learned from past relationships?\n* How do you stay grounded
  during difficult seasons?\n* What are your long-term goals and hopes?\n\n
 ### 💍 Bible Study Questions\n\n* What’s one prayer God has answered i
 n your life?\n* What Bible story inspires you most?\n* What’s something 
 you appreciate in Christian friendships?\n* What does “loving like Jesus
 ” look like in relationships?\n* What’s one quality you admire in stro
 ng Christian couples?\n* What’s something young Christians struggle with
  in dating today?\n* How can relationships help people grow spiritually?\n
 * What’s one piece of dating advice you think is underrated?\n* What’s
  your favorite way to serve others?\n* What helps you stay encouraged in y
 our faith?\n\n### 🌸 Fun Questions\n\n* Beach or mountains?\n* Worship n
 ight or game night?\n* Sunrise or sunset?\n* Texting or FaceTime?\n* Sweet
  snacks or salty snacks?\n* Road trip or staycation?\n* Big group hangout 
 or one-on-one time?\n* Fancy dinner or casual café?\n* Books or podcasts?
 \n\n### 📖 Fun but Meaningful\n\n* Which person in the Bible do you rela
 te to most and why?\n* If you could ask God one question right now\, what 
 would it be?\n* What does your “dream life” look like if God is at the
  center?
