SUMMARY:Mah Jongg Meetup: Spring Open Play
DESCRIPTION:PLEASE NOTE: You must sign up for EACH INDIVIDUAL SESSION. 
 Signing up for one session does not register you for any following 
 meetups.\n\nThe Mah Jongg Meetup provides a weekly opportunity for players 
 to continue practicing their established skills\, sharpen their 
 strategies\, build confidence at the game table\, and socialize with fellow 
 Mah Jongg players!\n\nThe library will provide five reserved tables in the 
 cafe! \n\nNOTE: Attendees should bring their personal sets to this meetup 
 and should already have an understanding of the Mah Jongg game. Attendees 
 should bring their 2025 or 2026 National Mah Jongg League card to the 
 meetup. Bringing an additional set is encouraged!\n\n*Note: There will be a 
 limited number of Mah Jongg sets available on a first-come\, first-served 
 basis.\n\nIf you're new to the game\, or don't feel comfortable sitting at 
 a table and playing with others at a similar level\, please register for a 
 Beginner class by clicking here.\n\n \n\nIMPORTANT 
 REMINDERS:\n\n\n	Students should have taken Beginner Mah Jongg or have 
 equivalent knowledge and experience. \n	Students should bring the 2025 
 National Mah Jongg League card to Open Play.\n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Cafe Area\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
UID:LibCal-10306-16462271
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16462271
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Libcal Bccls 10306": "https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16899954"}
X-SOURCE-ID:libcal_bccls_10306
X-SOURCE:Libcal Bccls 10306
DTSTART:20260615T150000Z
DTEND:20260615T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260615T000000Z
SUMMARY:Teach Yourself Mah Jongg - Weekly Monday Morning - NEW
DESCRIPTION:The Teach Yourself Mah Jongg provides a weekly opportunity for 
 teaching yourself the basics of American Mah Jongg at your own pace.\n\nThe 
 library will provide the book Beginner's Guide to American Mah Jongg by 
 Elaine Sandberg\, Mah Jongg card\, a set and table!  You can also boost 
 your learning with a list of  Mah Jongg resources available at the library. 
 \n\nAfter you know the basics of Mah Jongg\, and would like to play the 
 game with other Mah Jongg players\, please register for the weekly Thursday 
 or the weekly Saturday  "Mah Jongg Meetup".
LOCATION:Montclair Bellevue Ave Branch - Classroom
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Bellevue Avenue Branch":MAILTO:branch-events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Bellevue Avenue Branch
UID:LibCal-10306-16899954
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16899954
