DESCRIPTION:Join Campus Recreation for the new and exciting sport of stand
  up paddleboarding! We will head to the Wawayanda State Park for a relaxi
 ng\, fun day on the water. The lake is 1.5 miles long with multiple islan
 ds that can be gone around making exploring fun. \nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nR
 egister online through Fusion\, in the Student Recreation Center main off
 ice\, or over the phone (973-655-3340).\nCost for Students $10\;  $20 Fac
 ulty/Staff\nRegistration Opens on Fusion on Tuesday\, May 26\, 2026\n\nWh
 ere and When?\n\nJune 24\, 2026\n9:00 am - 5:00 pm \nBegins at Student Re
 creation Center\n\nWhat to bring: Water\, lunch\, bug spray\, sunscreen\,
  towel and bathing suit \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather change
 s\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisonous 
 plants\, and insect bites.\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional 
 Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/even
 t/12474131
DTEND:20260624T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260604T043640Z
