DESCRIPTION:Our current job market is impacted by valid anxiety\, low turn
 over\, and disruption driven by AI and economic uncertainty. While layoffs
  have decreased\, many businesses have slowed hiring. <br>Despite this "l
 ow-hire\, low-fire" dynamic\, tactics exist to help.<br>Join this workshop
  to level up your resume / LinkedIn to expand your professional community 
 and network your way to a new role.<br><br>FCC member\, Brian Mills\, is a
  proven research / design leader &amp\; coach in the global user experienc
 e community\, spanning roles in Fortune 50 regulated industries. <br><a 
 href="https://us.list-manage.com/19XfIxDu_KK?e=d2d6ac503b&amp\;c2id=e66210
 f379820045a1594f39332b2fb2" target="_blank">Click here for the Zoom link:<
 /a><br>Meeting ID: 96118414573<br>Passcode: 058317
