SUMMARY:Connection Cafe- In person
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260830T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260830T122000
DTSTAMP:20260604T044141Z
UID:o874lo1q9ekcedna70imb0c8rk_R20230319T150000@google.com__20260830
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20220609T153046Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u>You are invited to join us for our in person
  Connection Café every Sunday at 11:00 AM. Coffee will be provided. If yo
 u haven’t yet experienced our online Connection Café\, give it a try. P
 articipants report that this format allows us to build relationships acros
 s the congregation in ways that will sustain us as individual participants
  and support our growth as a community. So grab your coffee and join us fo
 r a fun way to connect on Sunday morning. All are welcome. We hope you can
  join us!&nbsp\;<br><br><br><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260423T121501Z
LOCATION:UUCM-1-Fletcher Hall (306)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:UU Congregation of Montclair
END:VEVENT
